    # Experimental, not upstreamed: skip_gated_clock_flops leaves out the
    # next-state comparison of a flop clocked through a cell kepler-formal
    # cannot model (an integrated clock gate's latch), lists each with a
    # warning, and compares the rest. Retires at a bump onto a
    # kepler-formal that models clock gates.
